    </div>
    <!-- Footer added to match the PDP's own mobile SIZE SHEET exactly (same
         "please select" nudge + ADD TO CART/BUY NOW pair as
         jiineva-product.liquid's #jnp-sizesheet-panel / #jnp-gil-sizesheet-panel)
         — colour is already resolved by the card's own swatches before this
         sheet ever opens (see openSizePicker below), so this sheet only ever
         has to ask about the option(s) that are still genuinely unresolved,
         same as PDP. -->
    <div class="jnc-qa-footer">
      <div class="jnc-qa-nudge" id="jnc-qa-nudge" role="alert" hidden></div>
      <div class="jnc-qa-actions">
