  <!-- ─── MEASUREMENT GUIDE ───────────────────────────────────────────
       The same "what if I don't know my size" answer the PDP already
       gives, brought onto the collection page so a shopper quick-adding
       from the grid never has to leave for the product page to find it.

       Content comes from this section's own four Measurement Guides
       settings, which carry the identical default text as the PDP's, so
       this works correctly the moment the file is pasted with nothing to
       fill in. Which of the four applies is decided exactly the way the
       PDP decides it — off product.type, same keywords, same ring
       fallback — except that here the card already publishes its type as
       data-category, so the matching happens in JS at open time rather
       than per card in Liquid. One copy of each guide on the page instead
       of one per product card.
  ── -->
  
  <div class="jnc-detail-overlay-bg" id="jnc-detail-overlay-bg"></div>
  <div class="jnc-detail-overlay-panel" id="jnc-detail-overlay-panel" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-hidden="true" aria-labelledby="jnc-detail-overlay-title">
